{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtFinrankWired","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtFinrankWired","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtFinrankWired.specht_finrank_eq_numSYT_wired","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtFinrankWired.specht_finrank_eq_numSYT_wired","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtFinrankWired.lean#L100-L108","doc":"**Standard-basis dimension theorem (wired).** `dim_k S^μ = #SYT(μ)`, read off\n`standardBasis_wired`. Mirrors `SpechtStandardBasis.specht_finrank_eq_numSYT`, but its\nindependence input is the *proved* triangular core — so this declaration's sorry-path is the\nspanning stub + dominance core only, and does **not** include the opaque brick-2 finrank stub\n`Specht.specht_finrank_eq_numSYT`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtFinrankWired.standardBasis_wired","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtFinrankWired.standardBasis_wired","kind":"def","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtFinrankWired.lean#L88-L98","doc":"**The standard polytabloid basis of `S^μ`, wired to proved independence.**\n\nMirrors `SpechtStandardBasis.standardBasis` (a `Module.Basis.mk` of the corestricted standard\npolytabloids), but its independence half is `standardPolytabloid_linearIndependent_wired`\n(sourced from the *proved* `triangular'`) and its spanning half is the existing\n`SpechtStandardBasis.standardPolytabloid_span`. Sorry-free apart from the spanning stub and the\ndominance core consumed by `triangular'`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtFinrankWired.standardPolytabloid_linearIndependent_wired","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtFinrankWired.standardPolytabloid_linearIndependent_wired","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtFinrankWired.lean#L74-L86","doc":"**Linear independence of the corestricted standard polytabloids — sourced from the PROVED\ntriangular core.** Identical conclusion to\n`SpechtStandardBasis.standardPolytabloid_linearIndependent`, but its triangular input is the\n*proved* `SpechtTriangularCore.standardPolytabloid_triangular'` (independence) rather than the\nopaque stub `SpechtStandardBasis.standardPolytabloid_triangular`. Hence this carries **no\nindependence `sorry`** — its only sorry-path is the dominance core that `triangular'` itself\nlegitimately consumes. ","signatureChunk":0}]}